    "name": "apaleo Platform Availability Settings API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Unified OpenAPI view of the apaleo API-first hotel property-management system. apaleo exposes its capabilities as a set of versioned REST APIs - Booking, Inventory, Rate Plan, Availability, Finance, and Settings - all served from https://api.apaleo.com and secured with OAuth 2.0 bearer tokens issued by the apaleo identity provider. Real-time events are delivered via the Webhook API at https://webhook.apaleo.com.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: apaleo Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
